\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Three-phase methodology for joint placement-policy optimisation. Phase~1 screens 4 placements crossed with a $2^3$ policy factorial; the surviving placement is carried into Phase~2 face-centred CCD with the empirical deadlock manifold $\mathcal  {D}_{P3}$ excluded as an infeasibility constraint per Myers, Montgomery \& Anderson-Cook \cite  {myers2016}, \S  7.5. The constrained-RSM optimum then becomes one of two candidate policies evaluated in Phase~3 against a Taguchi $L_9(3^4)$ orthogonal array over four operational noise factors. The framework yields a CapEx-OpEx-procedural recommendation suitable for industrial deployment.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
